Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[" XXZ bulk with Exchange edge coupling ", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"2b832914-403b-c04c-88d0-90a2e7ab54a6"],

Cell["\<\
 L total spins: edges A=1 and B=L, bulk M={2,...,L-1}. No magnetic fields are \
added. This notebook is self-contained. Evaluate its initialization cells \
once; the two static scans, state dynamics and channel dynamics then run \
independently. All model parameters are editable within their own run. g must \
be nonzero; Delta may be zero. These .m files use separate named contexts. \
Evaluate the Begin cell first: it saves the caller search path and restricts \
symbol lookup to System` while this file context is active. Evaluate the \
final cell to restore the path. Evaluate all required definition cells before \
a chosen run; run cells are executable. Get evaluates every run. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f0131925-c3a9-0c49-94ae-0edac440c240"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Begin", "[", "\"\<XXZExchange`\>\"", "]"}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{"XXZExchange`savedContextPath", "=", "$ContextPath"}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{"$ContextPath", "=", 
     RowBox[{"{", "\"\<System`\>\"", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", ")"}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{4.001121680392866*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8f801801-431f-ca4f-bab7-9f7a94353cf2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" 1. Statics: complete sector eigenpairs, entropies and IPR ", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"a8383a3d-aa7a-2f47-8da3-b052d13cf554"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" 1.1 Definitions shared by all four chapters ", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"dd7def0a-e63a-d94d-9ecf-248efa0a0828"],

Cell["\<\
 Initialization cells contain definitions only. They do not start a scan, \
diagonalize a model, choose an initial state, plot, or export. Their \
benchmark conventions are S=sigma/2, hbar=1, bit 0=up, natural-log entropy, \
edge basis {00,01,10,11}. Both end bonds replace the usual XXZ end bonds. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0c2bd326-051b-104e-9947-1cdecd2d567e"],

Cell["\<\
 H = J Sum[j=2,...,L-2](Sjx S(j+1)x + Sjy S(j+1)y + Delta Sjz S(j+1)z) + g \
(S1x S2x + S1y S2y + S(L-1)x SLx + S(L-1)y SLy). J and g have energy units. \
In the exchange case the spin-flip matrix element is g/2. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2eec5707-7912-ea4e-bc68-70aa4ddbf02e"],

Cell["\<\
 Exchange resolves total magnetization m and reflection R; at m=0 it also \
resolves spin flip F. Opposite-m spin-flip partners remain separate. Neither \
Delta=+1 nor Delta=-1 restores full-chain SU(2), because the end bonds \
contain only XY exchange. At Delta=0 the Hamiltonian is free fermionic \
(conditional bulk for ZZ); the benchmark spin/spatial classification stays \
valid, with additional conserved mode occupations and possible degeneracies. \
It is not a classification of every integrability charge. No degenerate \
energy vectors are silently mixed or pooled across the listed sectors. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6f372d41-d000-7e4f-aad6-337d648fbd89"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[" Utilities, spin operators and Hamiltonian guards ", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"1c087f5f-6230-5a4c-99be-22236ce0558d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"(", "\n", 
    RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "Stop", " ", "the", " ", "current", " ", "cell", " ", "if", " ", "an", " ",
       "input", " ", "or", " ", "validation", " ", 
      RowBox[{"fails", "."}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{"test_", ",", "message_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"!", 
         RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "test", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
           RowBox[{"message", ",", "Red"}], " ", "]"}], "]"}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"realQ", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"NumericQ", "[", "x", "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
       RowBox[{"NumberQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", " ", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
       RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Im", "[", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", " ", "]"}], "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], ";",
      "\n", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"id", "[", "n_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], "->", "1"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"n", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
