Cell["\<\
 Exchange clusters span all occupied total-magnetization sectors. ZZ needs \
only equal-energy contributions within the same bulk-magnetization sector, \
since the partial trace annihilates cross-bulk-sector terms. Both use bounded \
cluster width, not transitive chains of near-equalities. Vary \
AverageEnergyTolerance; exact degeneracies are preserved. The result is a \
spectral infinite-time average. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"488e762b-8b6a-4a45-97c9-6054a105c1b6"]
}, Closed]],

